# Paraguay Tech Community - Project Structure

## Project Overview
This is a Next.js 15 project for the Paraguay Tech community website, built with TypeScript, Tailwind CSS, and shadcn/ui components.

## Key Files and Structure
- **Main page**: [src/app/page.tsx](mdc:src/app/page.tsx) - Landing page with community information
- **Layout**: [src/app/layout.tsx](mdc:src/app/layout.tsx) - Root layout with metadata and fonts
- **Global styles**: [src/app/globals.css](mdc:src/app/globals.css) - Tailwind CSS configuration
- **Components**: [src/components/ui/](mdc:src/components/ui/) - shadcn/ui component library
- **Utils**: [src/lib/utils.ts](mdc:src/lib/utils.ts) - Utility functions (cn helper)
- **Config**: [components.json](mdc:components.json) - shadcn/ui configuration

## SEO and Performance
- **Sitemap**: [src/app/sitemap.ts](mdc:src/app/sitemap.ts) - Dynamic sitemap generation
- **Manifest**: [public/manifest.json](mdc:public/manifest.json) - PWA configuration
- **Robots**: [public/robots.txt](mdc:public/robots.txt) - Search engine directives
- **Static sitemap**: [public/sitemap.xml](mdc:public/sitemap.xml) - Static sitemap fallback

## Technology Stack
- **Framework**: Next.js 15 with App Router
- **Language**: TypeScript
- **Styling**: Tailwind CSS v4
- **UI Components**: shadcn/ui with Radix UI primitives
- **Icons**: Lucide React
- **Analytics**: Vercel Analytics
- **Fonts**: Geist Sans and Geist Mono

## Key Features
- Responsive design with mobile-first approach
- SEO optimized with structured data (JSON-LD)
- PWA capabilities with manifest
- Accessibility features (ARIA labels, semantic HTML)
- Performance optimized (lazy loading, proper meta tags)